	measure 'Top call reason' = ```
			
			    VAR TopSymptoms = 
			        SUMMARIZE(
			            'SWAST Calls',
			            'SWAST Calls'[Symptom_Group_Chief_Complaint],
			            "TotalCalls", SUM('SWAST Calls'[Care Home SWAST Calls])
			        )
			    VAR TopRanked = 
			        TOPN(
			            1,
			            TopSymptoms,
			            [TotalCalls], DESC,  -- Sort by TotalCalls in descending order
			            'SWAST Calls'[Symptom_Group_Chief_Complaint], ASC  -- Break ties alphabetically
			        )
			    RETURN
			        SELECTCOLUMNS(
			            TopRanked,
			            "TopSymptom", 'SWAST Calls'[Symptom_Group_Chief_Complaint]
			        )
			```
		lineageTag: ec82b634-d111-4418-ab8c-89e444564de0

